    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1200">

                <pb facs="1026" n="922" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg922"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.93/51.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Consular Agent at Guaymas.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 14, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Yours relative to commercial discrimination against Chinese. You will at once
                    take this up with appropriate authorities and urgently protest against these
                    discriminations. Insist that every legal and reasonable protection to which they
                    are entitled be afforded them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
